<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Tonga Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">BaFilipi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lugwalo lwaPawulu kuBaFilipu</para>
  <para style="toc2">BaFilipi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lugwalo LwaPawulu Ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">BAFILIPI</para>
  <para style="imt">Manjililo</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawulu wakalemba lugwalo kubasyomi bali muFilipi muchiindi chaminyaka ilimakumi alimusanu akkumi amunyaka uumwi kaali wazyalwa Kkirisitu. Wakalemba naakali muntolongo (BaFilipi 1:13), kweelede kuba kubusena bwaRoma. Lugwalo lwakalembelwa mbungano yakali muchisi chaFilipi. Tulakonzya kwiiya buniini atala aFilipi kuzwa mubbuku lyaInchito. Filipi chakali chisi chipati chachilikiti chamu Masedoniya. Alimwi yakali mbungano ntaanzi yakatalikwa muMasedoniya. Pawulu aamwi aSayilasi mbibakatalika mbungano eeyi amwi mpawo bakabikwa muntolongo busiku boonse nibakali nkukoko (Inchito 16:1-40).</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawulu wakali amizeezo myiingi mukulemba lugwalo oolu. Wakabelesya mweenya ooyu kukulumba imbungano nkaambo kachipo nchibakatumizya nibakamvwa kuti uli muntolongo (BaFilipi 4:10-19). Alubo wakapandulwida atala achiimo chakwe muntolongo mpawo wakabapa Timoti aEpafiroditasi kumbungano kuchitila kuti bakabatambule mpawo bakabalemeke mubweendelezi bwabo (BaFilipi 2:19-30).</para>
  <para style="iot">Bwiime</para>
  <para style="io1">Pawulu utalika lugwalo lwakwe akujuzya mbungano yamuFilipi (BaFilipi 1:1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Chitobela waabilana ambabo amwi makani atala achiimo chakwe amapenzi amumbungano (BaFilipi 1:3—2:30)</para>
  <para style="io1">Eelyo upa malayilile mayiingi atala akupona kwabunaKkirisitu (BaFilipi 3:1—4:9)</para>
  <para style="io1">Pawulu umanisya akulumba mbungano yabaFilipi kuzipo zyabo alimwi akubajuzya (BaFilipi 4:10-23)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">Inch 16:1</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 16:12-40">12-40</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:1">Rom 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 1:1">2 Kkor 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 1:10">Gal 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:1">Kkol 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 1:1">1 Tes 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 1:1">2 Tes 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1">Film</ref>.</char>
    </note> Ime Pawulu aamwi aTimoti, balanda <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">balanda </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nikuba bazike</char></note>baKkirisitu Jesu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">Kubasalali boonse bali muli Kkirisitu Jesu aabo bali kuFilipi, aamwi abazulwidi abasikukutawukila:<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:7">Rom 1:7</ref>.</char>
    </note> Luzyalo kulindinywe aluumuno luzwa kuli Leza Taata wesu aMwami Jesu Kkirisitu.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukomba aKulumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Ndilumba Leza wangu mukumuyeeya kwangu koonse, <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />munkombyo zyangu zyoonse nindimukombela lyoonse alukondo, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />nkaambo kabulyidilani mbutuli aabo mumakani mabotu kuzwa kubuzuba butaanzi kuyoosika lino. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:8">1 Kkor 1:8</ref>.</char></note> Alimwi kandijisi choonzyo kuti ooyo wakatalika mulimu mubotu mulindinywe uyoowumaninizya mubuzuba bwaKkirisitu Jesu. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:33">Inch 21:33</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 7:3">2 Kkor 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:20">Ef 6:20</ref>.</char></note> Zililuleme kulindime kuti mbundimvwa atala andinywe moonse, nkaambo muli mumoyo wangu, nkaambo moonse muli basimulimuma muluzyalo, mubwaange bwangu boonse amukulikwabilila akusinizya makani mabotu. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Nkaambo Leza ngukamboni wangu, kapati biyeni mbundikanza achiyandisyo atala aKkirisitu Jesu.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Alimwi nkukomba kwangu kuti luyando lwanu kalulokuvula kapati lyoonse, aluzibo amukulingula kwanu koonse, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />kuchitila kuti mukonzye kusala ziluleme, alimwi mube basalali akutaba akampenda mubuzuba bwaKkirisitu, <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />kamuzwide amicheelo yabusalali eeyo iza mukwiinda muli Jesu Kkirisitu, kuti kube bulemu antembawuzyo yaLeza.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupona NguKkirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:12. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 21:13">Luk 21:13</ref>.</char>
    </note> Nibakwesu, ndiyanda kuti muzibe, kuti eezyo zyakachitika kulindime zyakagwasya kuti makani mabotu aaya ayinkilile anembo, <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:30">Inch 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 2:9">2 Tim 2:9</ref>.</char></note> kuchitila kuti zizibigwe kuli basikulinda baŋanda yabwami akuli boonse kuti bwaange bwangu mbwankaambo kaKkirisitu, <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />alimwi bakwesu bayiingi bakaba alusinizyo muMwami nkaambo kabwaange bwangu, alimwi baba abusichaamba kapati mukukambawuka ijwi lyaLeza kabatakwe kuyoowa.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Bamwi bakambawuka Kkirisitu amoyo utaluleme akukazyaniya, pesi bamwi munzila iluleme. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Bakachita eezi nkaambo kaluyando, kabazi kuti ndilimomuno nkaambo kakulwanina makani mabotu, <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />bamwi bakale bakakambawuka Kkirisitu abusindya, peepe mubululami, pesi kabayeeya kundibusizya nkondo mubwaange bwangu.<verse eid="PHP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Tutyeni kabi? Kunze akuti munzila yoonse, nikuba mukuupawupa nikuba mukasimpe, Kkirisitu ulakambawukwa; alimwi muleezyo ndilakondwa,<verse eid="PHP 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:19. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:7">Inch 16:7</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 1:11">2 Kkor 1:11</ref>.</char>
    </note> nkaambo ndilizi kuti mukwiinda munkombyo zyanu akugwasigwa aMuuya waJesu Kkirisitu eezi ziyooba lufutuko lwangu, <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:8">Rom 14:8</ref>.</char></note> mbuli mbundili abulangilizi bwangu anzindilangilila kuti tandikwe kukuyoofwisyigwa bweeme nikuba munzila yoonse, pesi kuti abusichamba buzwide lino mbuli lubbe nikuba lino Kkirisitu uyoopegwa bulemu mumubili wangu, nikuba kandipona nikuba ndafwa. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:20">Gal 2:20</ref>.</char></note> Nkaambo kulindime kupona nguKkirisitu, alimwi kufwa nimpindu. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Kuti kakuli kupona mumubili, chaamba kuti eeyi michelo yamabelekabeleka angu. Anukuti eecho nchindisala tandikonzyi pe kwaamba. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Ndili syanikizidwe akati kazibili. Chiyandisyo changu nchakweenda mpawo ndikabe aKkirisitu, nkaambo eechi nchiichicho chilikabotu loko, <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />pesi kuba mumubili kuleelede loko nkaambo kanu. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Lino ndijisi choonzyo acheechi, ndilizi kuti ndiyoochala akweenda anembo andinywe moonse, nkaambo kakuzwidilila kwanu amulukondo mulusyomo, <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />kuchitila kuti kandila anywebo kulikankayizizya kwanu muli Kkirisitu Jesu kukayungizigwe nkaambo kangu kukuboola kwangu lubo kulindinywe.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Nikubabobo buumi bwanu ngabube bweelela makani mabotu aKkirisitu, kuchitila kuti naa ndasika akuzomubona nikuba nkanditawo pe, ndiyoomvwa atala andinywe kuti muliimvwi nji muMuuya uumwi, amuzeezo uumwi kamuli kukakatila kulubazu akulubazu nkaambo kalusyomo lwamakani mabotu, <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:28. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 1:5">2 Tes 1:5</ref>.</char></note> alimwi peepe kuyosyegwa kufumbwa chintu abasinkondonyokwe. Eechi nchitondezyo chili antanganana kulimbaabo chakuti bayoonyonyoonwa, pesi mulufutuko lwanu, alimwi oolo luzwa kuli Leza. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Nkaambo kulipedwe kulindinywe kuti nkaambo kaKkirisitu kuti tamweleede kuzumina luzutu mulinguwe biyo pesi akupenzegwa lubo nkaambo kakwe, <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-40">Inch 16:19-40</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 2:2">1 Tes 2:2</ref>.</char></note>kamuli mumwi mukupenzegwa kukozyene ankumwakabona mpawo lino mulookukumvwa kakuli kwangu.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuli Fwiinsya aBupati BwaKkirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 13:14">2 Kkor 13:14</ref>.</char>
    </note> Aboobo kuti kakuli kusungwazigwa muli Kkirisitu nikuba kumbulizigwa kuzwa kuluyando nikuba mubulidilani muMuuya nikuba kufwidilana nsoni aluse, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />amukazuzikizye lukondo lwangu akuba amuzeezo uumwi, kamujisi luyando lumwi, kamuzwide muuya uumwi amuzeezo uumwi. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:10">Rom 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 15:1-2">15:1-2</ref>.</char></note> Kutabi nzimuchita abusindya nikuba kulikankayizya, pesi mukulibombya amulange bamwi kabalimbubo kwiinda ndinywe. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Kutakabi naba uumwi ulilanga lwakwe luzutu, pesi alubo anzibayanda bamwi. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:29">Mat 11:29</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:28">20:28</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:1">Jn 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 8:9">2 Kkor 8:9</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 5:8">Hebb 5:8</ref>.</char></note> Ngamube amuzeezo ooyu akati kanu, ooyu wakali muli Kkirisitu Jesu,<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />ooyo, nikuba kuti wakali muchiimo chaLeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">takukwe naakayanda kweelana aLeza nchiichintu nchitweleede kujatisisya,<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />pesi wasiya zyoonse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">wakabweza chiimo chabulanda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">chabulanda </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nikuba muzike</char></note>, kazyedwe muchiimo chabantu.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Alimwi wakajanwa muchiimo chamuntu wakalifwinsiya mpawo wakaswilila mane kuyoosika kulufu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">nikuba lufu achiingano.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:9. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 10:9">Rom 10:9</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 14:9">14:9</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:20-21">Ef 1:20-21</ref>.</char>
    </note>nkaambo kaako Leza wakamusumpula loko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">wamupa izina lyiinda mazina woonse,<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />kuti muzina lyaJesu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">mazwi woonse ayofugama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">kujulu aanyika akunsi anyika,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />alimwi ndimi zyoonse zikakuzumine kuti Jesu Kkirisitu nguMwami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">kubulemu bwaLeza Taata.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyenyeezi Munyika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Nkikaako, nibayandwa, mbuli mbumuswiilila lyoonse, peepe nindiliwo luzutu pesi lino kapati ninditawo pe, amubeleke lufutuko lwanu mukuyoowa amukulifwiinsya; <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:10">1 Kkor 15:10</ref>.</char></note>nkaambo nguLeza ubeleka mulindinywe, akumuchita kuti muyandisye akuchita chibotu eecho nchayanda.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Amuchite zintu zyoonse kamutakwe lungungu nikuba kukazyaniya, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:45">Mat 5:45</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 5:48">48</ref>.</char></note> kuti mube batakwe kampenda alimwi baluleme, bana baLeza batakwe kampenda akati kabaabo bakompeme izyalani lipilingene, akati kabo inywe nimumweeka mbuli nyenyeezi munyika, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />kamujatisisya ijwi lyabuumi, kuchitila kuti mubuzuba bwaKkirisitu ndikakube amantukwe kuti tendakachijana chabuyo nikuba kubeleka chabuyo pe.<verse eid="PHP 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Nikuba kuti ndabbomweedwa achipayililo mbuli chipo chakunywa chipayililwa nkaambo kamulimu walusyomo lwanu chipayililwa kuli Leza, ndilakondwa akubotelwa aamwi andinywe moonse. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Mbumbubo anywebo mweelede kukondwa akubotelwa andime.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timoti aEpafiroditasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Ndilabulangilizi muMwami Jesu kuti nditume Timoti kulindinywe akufwaambana, kuchitila kuti ndikasungwazigwe nindakamvwa amakani aanu. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Tandikwe ulimbuli nguwe pe, mukozu wachoonzyo uyeeya atala andinywe. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Bamwi boonse bayanda kulilanga lwabo beni, peepe eezyo zyaJesu Kkirisitu. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Pesi mulizizi kale Timoti mbwapona kabotu, mbuli mwana awisi mbwakabeleka andime mumakani mabotu. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Nkikaako ndili abulangilizi bwakumutuma akufwambana mbuli mbunditabone kuti zilandeendela biyeni; <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />alimwi ndilasyoma muMwami kuti mukayindi kaniini ndilaboola andime.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Ndayeeya kuti kuleelede kutuma Epafiroditasi mukwesu simulimuma alimwi silumambama alimwi mutumwa wako asimulimu kuli nzindiyanda, <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />nkaambo wakali achiyandisyo chakumubona moonse, alimwi wakawusa nkaambo mwakamvwa kuti wakali kuchiswa. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Nichoonzyo wakali kuchiswa, afwiifwi akufwa. Pesi Leza wakamufwida luse; kuteensi alinguwe luzutu pesi akulindime lubo, kuchitila kuti nditabi amawuse atala amawuse. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Ndili achiyandisyo chakumutuma lubo we, nkikaako, kuti mukabotelwe mwaakumubona lubo, kuti alimwi kucheye kulikatazya kwangu. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Aboobo amumutambule alukondo loonse muMwami; alimwi mulemeke bantu baliboobo, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />nkaambo wakali waamba kufwa nkaambo kamulimu waKkirisitu, katakata buumi bwakwe kuti amane ooyo mulimu wanu ngumwakakachilwa kuchita kulindime.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Busalali Bwini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Nibakwesu, kumamanino, amubotelwe muMwami. Kumulembela zintu zikozyeene tee penzi pe kulindime, alimwi kulindinywe ndugwasyo kuti ndizichite.<verse eid="PHP 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Amuchenjelele aabo bantu bali mbuli bankala, amuchenjele basimuchita zibi, amuchenjele bayungi bamubili. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:28-29">Rom 2:28-29</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 6:14-15">Gal 6:14-15</ref>.</char></note> Nkaambo tuli abupalulwe bwakasimpe, aabo bakomba Leza mumuuya, abulemu muliKkirisitu Jesu, mutabi akulikankayizya mumubili. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Inch 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:3-21">22:3-21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 23:6">23:6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:4-23">26:4-23</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:1">Rom 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 11:18-31">2 Kkor 11:18-31</ref>.</char></note> Nikuba kuti ambebo ndilijisi kulikankayizya mumubili. Kuti kakuli uumwi muntu uyeeya kuti ulaanzila yakulikankayizya mumubili, ime ndiliyindilide: <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Ndakapalulwa mubuzuba bwamusanu aatatu, muchiyanza chabantu baIzirayeli, wamukowa waBbenjamini, alimwi ndili muHebburu wakazyalwa abaHebburu; mukujata zyamulawu ndili muFarisi, <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />mbuli kukulipeda ndili sikupenzya wambungano, mukuchita bululami buli aansi amulawu butakwe kampenda pe. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Pesi kufumbwa zintu zyoonse zyakali kundipa mpindu, zyakaba zyabuyo nkaambo kaKkirisitu. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Atala zeezi zyoonse zyakaba zyabuyo, nkaambo kaluzibo lwindilide lwakuziba Kkirisitu Jesu Mwami wangu. Nkaambo kakwe ndakasweekelwe zintu zyoonse, akuzibona kazili masifwisifwi, kuchitila kuti ndijane Kkirisitu <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />akuti ndijanwe mulinguwe, kanditakwe bululami bwangu ndimwini, oobo buzwa kumulawu, pesi oobo buli mukwiinda mulusyomo lwaKkirisitu, abululami buzwa kuli Leza mukwiinda aboobo buli mulusyomo; <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />kuti ndikamuzibe anguzu zyakubuka bwakwe, alimwi tukakonzye kwabilana mumapenzi aakwe, akuba mbuli nguwe mulufu lwakwe, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />kuchitila kuti muli iimwi nzila ndikaakujane bubuke kuzwa kubafu.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubindaanina Mpalamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Teensi kwaamba kuti ndachijana kale eechi, nikuba kuti ndililuleme kale; pesi ndidunaminina kuti chibe changu eecho Kkirisitu nchakandijanina. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Bakwesu, nsili kulituntuzya kuti ndakazichita kale ime lwangu; pesi chintu chimwi nchindichita, kuluba zilimusule alimwi akudunaminina kunembo kuzintu zilikunembo, <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Ndiladunaminina mpalamo yampindu yalwiito lwaLeza lwangu lwakujulu muliKkirisitu Jesu.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Amuleke aabo besu bakakomena mumuuya babe amuzeezo uumwi; nikuba kuti balaaba ayiimwi mizeezo isiyene abamwi, Leza ulamuyubunwida eecho anywebo. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Atujatisye kukasimpe luzutu kuli eecho nchitwakajana.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:17. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:15-17">1 Kkor 4:15-17</ref>.</char>
    </note> Bakwesu, amube antoomwe andime mukundiiya, alimwi mwiiye aabo bapona mbuli ndinywe balaachitondeezyo chabuumi mbutupona. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Nkaambo bayiingi, aabo mbindakamwaambila kayiingi alimwi lino nikuba ndilikumwaambila kandili amisozi, bapona mbuli basinkondonyina bachiingano chaKkirisitu. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Alimwi mamanino aabo ndunyonyooko, leza wabo mbula, alimwi bapa bulemu bwabo masampu aabo, mizeezo yabo ilikumisalo yaansi anyika. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Pesi bukkale bwesu buli kujulu, alimwi kuzwa muli mbubo tulabulangilizi bwaMufutuli, Mwami Jesu Kkirisitu, <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:35-58">1 Kkor 15:35-58</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:4">Kkol 3:4</ref>.</char></note> ooyo uyoosandula mibili yabo ikompeme, kuti ukabe mbuli mubili wakwe wabulemu, mukwiinda munguzu zimukonzezya, nikuba kweendelezya zintu zyoonse kulinguwe.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s">Malayilile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Nimuyandwa, nkikaako, aabo mbundiyandisya kubona lubo, lukondo lwangu amusini, munzila eeyi amwimikile nji muMwami, nimuyandwa.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Ndamukumbila Iyuwodiya aSiyinteki kuti muzuminane muMwami. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:20">Luk 10:20</ref>.</char></note> Alimwi ndamukumbila andinywe lubo, simulimuma wakasimpe, ugwasizye banakazi aaba, nkaambo bakabeleka lubazu alubazu aamwi andime mukukambawuka makani mabotu aamwi aKkilementi mpawo aboonse bamwi basimulimuma, aabo mazina aabo alimubbuku lyabuumi.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Amubotelwe muMwami chiindi choonse; ndayindulula lubo, amubotelwe.<verse eid="PHP 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Amuleke bantu boonse bazibe kulibombya kwanu. Mwami waba afwiifwi. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6:25-34</ref>.</char></note> Mutalikatazyi nikubaanzi, pesi mulizyoonse akube akukomba akukumbilila akupa kulumba amuchite kuti kukumbila kwanu kuzibikane kuli Leza. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Alimwi luumuno lwaLeza, lwiinda kumvwisisisya koonse, buyoobamba myoyo yanu amizeezo yanu muli Kkirisitu Jesu.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Bakwesu, kumamanino, kufumbwa chakasimpe, kufumbwa chilabulemu, kufumbwa chiluleme, kufumbwa chisalala, kufumbwa chiyandisi, kufumbwa chebeesyi, kuti kakuli bubotu, kuti kakuli chintu cheelela kulumbilizigwa, muyeeye atala azintu eezi. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:33">Rom 15:33</ref>.</char></note>Eezyo nzimwakayiya akutambuula akumvwa alimwi nzimwakabona mulindime, muzichite; alimwi Leza waluumuno uyooba andinywe.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulumba Kwachipo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:10. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:9">2 Kkor 11:9</ref>.</char>
    </note> Ndilabotelwa muMwami kapati kuti lino kubulamfu mwabukulusya chiyandisyo chanu kulindime; mwakali achiyandisyo choonzyo kulindime, pesi teemwakali amweenya wakuzichita pe. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Peepe kuti ndilanyontooka anzindiyanda; nkaambo ndakayiya, kufumbwa muchiimo nchindili nchicho, kuti ndeelede kukkutikana. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Ndilikwizi kubula, alimwi ndilikwizi kujana, muli kufumbwa amuzyiimo zyoonse ndakayiya insiinswa yakulangana azyiingi alimwi ndikwiizi kuba anzala, akkuta. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 12:9">2 Kkor 12:9</ref>.</char></note>Ndilakonzya kuchita zintu zyoonse mulinguwe ooyo undipanguzu.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Anukuti chakali chibotu kulindinywe kuti twaabilane penzi lyangu. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Alimwi inywe lwanu niba kuFilipi mulizi kuti kumatalikilo akukambawuka amakani mabotu kulindinywe, nindakayeenda kuzwa muMasedoniya, takukwe mbungano yakali kundigwasya mukwiindila muzipo azimwi akutambula kunze kwandinywe luzutu; <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">Inch 17:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 2:9">1 Tes 2:9</ref>.</char></note> alimwi nikuba nindakali kuTesalonika mwakalikunditumizya lugwasyo twiinda lumwi. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Peepe kuti ndiyanduula chipo, pesi ndiyanduula impindu iyungizya kuli nchimulacho kale. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Ndakatambula luliyo luzwide, alimwi zyindilide; ndilizwide, nzindakatambula kulindinywe zyakeetwa aEpafiroditasi zipo nzimwatumizya, chipo chinunkilila, chipayizyo chitambulika akubotezya kuliLeza. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Alimwi Leza wangu uyoomwabila zyoonse nzimuyanda mukwiindila mubuvubi mbwajisi mubulemu muliKkirisitu Jesu. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Kuli Leza wesu aTaata akube bulemu kwalyoonse alyoonse. Ameni.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujuzya Kwakumamanino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Amujuzye musalali woonse muli Kkirisitu Jesu. Bakwesu mbindili aabo balamujuzya. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Boonse basalali balamujuzya, kapati balimuŋanda yaSiza.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:23. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 6:18">Gal 6:18</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:25">Film25</ref>.</char>
    </note> Luzyalo lwaMwami Jesu Kkirisitu lube amuuya wanu.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>